WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.020
Imagine a friend asks
you to keep a secret,

2
00:00:03.070 --> 00:00:05.750
but keeping it could hurt someone else.

3
00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:09.010
Some people would say
a promise is a promise:

4
00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:12.230
some acts are right or
wrong in themselves.

5
00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:17.100
Others would ask which choice brings
the best results for everyone involved.

6
00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:20.950
So when a hard choice comes,
should you follow the rules,

7
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.120
do the most loving thing, or
aim for the happiest result?

8
00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:28.060
In this mission, you will
meet ethical theories,

9
00:00:28.110 --> 00:00:32.660
methods for deciding what is
right, and try each one as a tool.

10
00:00:32.710 --> 00:00:38.110
Then you will test them on hard cases,
and spot which tool an argument is using.

11
00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:42.170
Your mission: find out which
tool each argument is using,

12
00:00:42.220 --> 00:00:43.890
and what each one misses.
